# Neural video backend (optional). Copy to .env.local and fill in YOUR OWN
# credentials. Never commit real keys — .env.local is gitignored.
#
# Any image-to-video API that accepts multipart form fields
# (image, prompt, aspect_ratio, resolution, audio) works.
#
# VIDOU_VIDEO_PROVIDER_URL=https://api.your-provider.com/v1/image-to-video
# VIDOU_VIDEO_PROVIDER_KEY=your-key-here
